# Held by docs/crypto/check.py (docs/CRYPTO-LEARN.md §7). The count of
# [[not_crypto]] entries in docs/crypto/actions.toml: a function the
# inventory's rules find that computes nothing on a secret or signed data.
# It only falls; raising it is the owner's decision, recorded in DECISIONS.
not_crypto 6
# The count of `[[action.screens_not]]` entries: a screen whose code calls an
# action's root and does not offer the action (docs/CRYPTO-LEARN.md §9.2). It only
# falls; raising it is the owner's decision, recorded in DECISIONS (F164).
screens_not 22
# Held by docs/crypto/check.py (docs/ESTABLISHED.md §2.2). The count of
# `implementation.written_here` pieces in docs/crypto/actions.toml: what Faraday writes
# itself, each with its reason and decision. It only falls; raising it is the owner's
# decision, recorded in DECISIONS (F178, F180).
written_here 39
# The count of `[[not_established]]` entries: libraries the actions name that no
# trusted publisher or imported audit establishes (ESTABLISHED §1.2). It only falls;
# raising it is the owner's decision, recorded in DECISIONS (F180).
not_established 3
